WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.180 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 17=

01:52.747 --> 01:53.187
I'm home.

01:55.060 --> 01:55.866
You're finally back.

01:56.747 --> 01:58.866
I bought you boiled meatball soup.

01:58.866 --> 01:59.827
Try it.

01:59.907 --> 02:01.146
What a coincidence.

02:01.627 --> 02:03.467
I brought you a fried pork cutlet.

02:06.946 --> 02:08.466
This is expensive.

02:09.107 --> 02:10.347
Mr. Yuan treated us today.

02:11.026 --> 02:12.107
Mr. Yuan?

02:12.827 --> 02:13.746
Who's that?

02:14.080 --> 02:16.410
The most well-known
lianhuanhua comic artist in Jiangcheng.

02:16.706 --> 02:18.186
He saw my assignments

02:18.220 --> 02:19.906
and specifically came to
the newspaper office to find me.

02:19.906 --> 02:21.170
He wants me to draw lianhuanhua.

02:21.947 --> 02:22.746
It's paid work.

02:23.026 --> 02:23.866
Really?

02:24.107 --> 02:25.547
That's great.

02:25.827 --> 02:27.347
I knew you could do it.

02:34.660 --> 02:35.290
It smells great.

02:35.906 --> 02:37.827
Didn't you just have Western food?

02:37.866 --> 02:39.026
Why are you still hungry?

02:39.146 --> 02:40.067
I'm full.

02:40.706 --> 02:41.706
But you brought me this,

02:42.080 --> 02:42.906
I have to finish it.

02:44.146 --> 02:44.947
I'm eating it too.

02:48.906 --> 02:49.706
Is it still warm?

02:50.960 --> 02:52.450
I'll take you somewhere after we eat.

02:54.146 --> 02:54.947
Okay.

03:00.706 --> 03:01.026
Stop.

03:02.706 --> 03:03.785
Don't open your eyes yet.

03:08.186 --> 03:08.987
Open them now.

03:14.866 --> 03:16.306
Xinhua Bookstore Warehouse.

03:16.372 --> 03:19.410
(No Smoking)

03:20.987 --> 03:21.306
You...

03:22.906 --> 03:24.746
Where did you get the key?

03:25.067 --> 03:25.866
It's Ms. Liu.

03:27.107 --> 03:29.547
She's President Fu's wife.

03:30.067 --> 03:32.267
She manages this warehouse.

03:32.827 --> 03:34.306
She said that after work,

03:34.547 --> 03:35.706
we can read any books here.

03:36.067 --> 03:37.626
Just don't take them out

03:37.947 --> 03:39.267
or let anyone find out.

03:55.306 --> 03:56.186
Fang Muyang.

03:56.906 --> 03:57.706
Fang Muyang.

03:58.947 --> 03:59.626
Fang Muyang.

03:59.746 --> 04:00.306
I'm here.

04:01.426 --> 04:02.866
You scared me.

04:03.227 --> 04:04.306
I turned off the light.

04:04.306 --> 04:05.746
We can't let anyone know we're here.

04:06.426 --> 04:07.746
You can't read these books

04:08.507 --> 04:10.146
with the light on.

04:11.026 --> 04:12.347
They're all sealed storage copies.

04:13.472 --> 04:13.897
(Train Ticket with a Star)

04:13.897 --> 04:14.585
(The Tale of Calling A Deer a Horse)

04:14.585 --> 04:15.197
(Train Ticket with a Star)

04:15.197 --> 04:16.247
(The Stranger)

04:16.247 --> 04:17.072
(Train Ticket with a Star)

04:26.718 --> 04:30.893
♪Summer, by my ears♪

04:31.172 --> 04:35.335
♪The wind sweeps through
the wheat fields♪

04:35.620 --> 04:40.060
♪Cicadas sing on the treetops♪

04:40.060 --> 04:43.860
♪Writing the language of youth♪

04:43.860 --> 04:48.460
♪Smiles in my eyes♪

04:48.460 --> 04:52.540
♪Sweet as if dipped in honey♪

04:53.260 --> 04:57.180
♪Watching the sunset♪

04:57.180 --> 05:01.735
♪Stain the passing years red♪

05:02.122 --> 05:05.910
♪Talk a little, listen a little♪

05:05.985 --> 05:10.220
♪Let time settle♪

05:10.860 --> 05:14.660
♪Feel the warm breeze♪

05:14.660 --> 05:19.420
♪Carry us into tomorrow♪

05:19.420 --> 05:23.260
♪When someday, some promise♪

05:23.260 --> 05:27.820
♪Is treasured deep inside our hearts♪

05:27.820 --> 05:37.180
♪It beomces the most beautiful moment
we pursue together♪

05:37.347 --> 05:40.935
♪Talk a little, listen a little♪

05:40.997 --> 05:45.297
♪Let time settle♪

05:45.922 --> 05:49.772
♪Feel the warm breeze♪

05:49.835 --> 05:54.797
♪Carry us into tomorrow♪

05:54.960 --> 05:58.522
♪When someday, some promise♪

05:58.522 --> 06:02.780
♪Is treasured deep inside our hearts♪

06:02.780 --> 06:07.820
♪It beomces the most beautiful moment♪

06:07.820 --> 06:12.100
♪We pursue together♪

06:19.826 --> 06:21.626
What have you been reading lately?

06:23.506 --> 06:26.746
Grey covers and yellow covers.

06:29.227 --> 06:30.347
Internal distribution?

06:30.987 --> 06:31.306
Yes.

06:32.347 --> 06:34.467
"The Catcher in the Rye",

06:34.626 --> 06:35.467
"The Stranger",

06:35.787 --> 06:38.826
"Train Ticket with a Star",
and "Waiting for Godot".

06:39.946 --> 06:40.946
Do you like them?

06:41.746 --> 06:42.506
I do.

06:43.027 --> 06:45.426
"The Catcher in the Rye" is my favorite.

06:45.866 --> 06:46.907
I've read it many times.

06:47.506 --> 06:48.907
No wonder.

06:49.907 --> 06:51.667
Your writing was always good,

06:51.667 --> 06:54.227
but it still felt like a student's work.

06:54.426 --> 06:55.587
Now,

06:57.667 --> 06:59.266
it feels like a writer's.

07:00.506 --> 07:01.306
Really?

07:01.707 --> 07:02.506
Really.

07:04.506 --> 07:06.506
I thought you'd give up
literature and writing

07:06.707 --> 07:09.147
after you got married.

07:10.027 --> 07:10.907
I didn't expect that.

07:11.826 --> 07:13.147
You surprised me.

07:14.626 --> 07:15.667
It's Fang Muyang.

07:19.464 --> 07:21.664
He does the same thing you do.

07:22.347 --> 07:23.147
He encourages me

07:23.866 --> 07:24.667
and helps me.

07:26.426 --> 07:27.426
Fang Muyang?

07:29.147 --> 07:30.266
I remember

07:30.386 --> 07:33.907
he doesn't read much himself.

07:38.707 --> 07:40.547
You must keep writing.

07:56.266 --> 07:57.386
So abundant.

07:58.347 --> 08:00.306
We're celebrating.

08:03.210 --> 08:04.186
What are we celebrating?

08:04.467 --> 08:05.027
Celebrate

08:05.386 --> 08:06.707
Ms. Fei Ni

08:06.707 --> 08:09.347
for winning third prize
in Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory's

08:09.347 --> 08:10.946
blackboard newspaper competition.

08:14.787 --> 08:15.746
What about second prize?

08:17.147 --> 08:18.227
How did you know

08:18.426 --> 08:20.946
the second prize was also Ms. Fei Ni?

08:20.970 --> 08:22.027
Don't tell me first prize...

08:22.027 --> 08:23.866
Yeah. That's right.

08:24.186 --> 08:25.306
Ms. Fei Ni won that too.

08:25.547 --> 08:27.306
People keep saying

08:27.306 --> 08:29.707
Workshop One's blackboard is the best,

08:29.707 --> 08:31.186
so everyone asks me to design theirs.

08:31.186 --> 08:33.060
Even the canteen's blackboard
was done by me.

08:33.187 --> 08:34.067
I told you.

08:34.587 --> 08:35.587
You're gold.

08:36.067 --> 08:37.067
You'll shine eventually.

08:38.347 --> 08:38.947
You know what?

08:39.070 --> 08:40.786
The leaders came to inspect
earlier today.

08:40.786 --> 08:43.386
They said the blackboards
are well done.

08:43.906 --> 08:46.146
They mentioned "Unity, Alertness,

08:46.146 --> 08:47.307
Seriousness, and Liveliness."

08:47.307 --> 08:49.947
They even took photos
for a future exhibition.

08:50.827 --> 08:51.947
Writer Fei Ni,

08:52.187 --> 08:53.347
I'm going to keep every word

08:53.347 --> 08:54.906
you write.

08:54.987 --> 08:56.750
When you're famous,
I'll sell them for money.

08:57.860 --> 08:59.386
Even if the blackboards are well done,

08:59.386 --> 09:00.987
they won't earn any money.

09:01.906 --> 09:02.987
But

09:03.467 --> 09:05.307
when someone appreciates my writing,

09:05.587 --> 09:06.866
I'm truly happy.

09:07.347 --> 09:09.947
I visited Ms. Chen today.

09:10.187 --> 09:11.107
She

09:12.146 --> 09:13.587
praised my writing

09:13.746 --> 09:15.987
and said I write like a real writer.

09:16.107 --> 09:17.146
I was especially happy.

09:17.947 --> 09:18.786
So

09:18.866 --> 09:22.266
I got two little crabs to treat you.

09:22.506 --> 09:23.666
I owe you during this period.

09:24.947 --> 09:25.746
Try some.

09:28.307 --> 09:29.386
After you, Fang Muyang.

09:32.146 --> 09:33.546
Congratulations, Ms. Fei Ni,

09:34.120 --> 09:34.947
on winning the award.

09:36.067 --> 09:36.866
Cheers.

09:37.187 --> 09:37.626
Cheers.

09:43.906 --> 09:44.786
Fang Muyang.

09:47.587 --> 09:48.707
Do you know?

09:50.107 --> 09:51.347
I almost gave up.

09:53.307 --> 09:53.987
Gave up what?

09:57.187 --> 09:58.546
Gave up

09:59.347 --> 10:00.227
going to college,

10:01.386 --> 10:03.386
the housing allocation,

10:03.587 --> 10:05.107
and writing.

10:05.347 --> 10:07.746
Because no one understood me

10:07.746 --> 10:09.067
or believed me.

10:17.947 --> 10:19.146
Luckily, I had you.

10:20.707 --> 10:21.827
Luckily,

10:22.427 --> 10:24.786
you were always by my side,

10:25.307 --> 10:26.546
helping me

10:28.347 --> 10:29.146
and encouraging me.

10:31.146 --> 10:32.467
I'm really,

10:33.107 --> 10:34.187
truly

10:35.587 --> 10:36.386
grateful to you.

10:45.786 --> 10:47.107
You don't need to thank me.

10:51.386 --> 10:52.187
You're right.

10:52.546 --> 10:53.707
Let me put it another way.

10:59.827 --> 11:00.626
I'm happy

11:01.947 --> 11:04.146
I met you.

11:05.347 --> 11:06.746
I feel very lucky too.

11:10.786 --> 11:11.707
I'm also very lucky

11:13.307 --> 11:14.307
to meet you again.

11:21.906 --> 11:22.827
Fang Muyang,

11:23.146 --> 11:24.026
I feel like

11:24.386 --> 11:27.747
I'm getting closer and closer
to the north.

11:30.467 --> 11:30.987
Fei Ni,

11:32.107 --> 11:33.467
I have a gift for you.

11:34.386 --> 11:35.546
What gift?

11:39.587 --> 11:41.906
(Fei Ni's Works Exhibition)
Fei Ni's...

11:50.746 --> 11:52.947
What works do I even have?

11:53.506 --> 11:54.947
Open it, and you'll see.

12:11.427 --> 12:12.107
You...

12:15.987 --> 12:17.987
When did you find out?

12:20.746 --> 12:22.666
The day you came back from the factory.

12:23.187 --> 12:24.427
I searched for a long time

12:24.546 --> 12:26.187
in your books and gathered all these.

12:26.580 --> 12:27.906
I pasted them together bit by bit.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.685
(Cotton, breathable, comfortable.
Gauze for sleeve, light and thin)

12:34.685 --> 12:36.135
(Two centimeters wider than hip line.
Pleats, collar length)

12:43.187 --> 12:44.587
They are beautiful.

12:46.067 --> 12:47.347
Although we never had the chance

12:47.827 --> 12:48.987
to make them,

12:49.467 --> 12:50.107
at least

12:50.626 --> 12:52.146
I can draw them on you.

13:17.260 --> 13:21.747
(Unite and Achieve Greater Victory!)

13:34.560 --> 13:36.750
(I'm going to Jiangcheng University
to see my sister.)

13:36.827 --> 13:38.146
(Eat before going to work.)

13:38.546 --> 13:39.587
(Fang Muyang)
(If you're still not feeling well,)

13:39.786 --> 13:40.587
(take a day off.)

13:47.935 --> 13:51.022
(Education Must Be Combined
with Productive Labor)

13:51.067 --> 13:54.067
Mujing, why didn't you tell me
you came back to Jiangcheng?

13:54.987 --> 13:56.146
I came for work,

13:56.347 --> 13:57.506
not for a family visit.

13:58.906 --> 13:59.987
How did you know I was here?

14:00.107 --> 14:01.187
Hua told me.

14:02.187 --> 14:03.386
He bought these for you

14:03.390 --> 14:04.740
and asked me to give them to you.

14:05.786 --> 14:07.266
I don't need them. Take them away.

14:10.947 --> 14:11.427
Mujing,

14:12.026 --> 14:13.386
you two are husband and wife.

14:14.660 --> 14:16.467
Some things should
be talked through openly.

14:17.180 --> 14:18.506
Don't keep everything bottled up,

14:19.146 --> 14:20.490
and you shouldn't act out of anger.

14:20.506 --> 14:22.307
A job transfer is a big deal.

14:22.467 --> 14:23.987
Wasn't it unreasonable

14:25.067 --> 14:26.506
not to discuss it with him?

14:27.506 --> 14:28.987
Did Qu Hua complain about me to you?

14:29.107 --> 14:30.666
That's not complaining.

14:31.266 --> 14:32.666
He was confiding in me.

14:33.746 --> 14:34.146
Mujing,

14:34.626 --> 14:36.307
Hua cares about you.

14:37.107 --> 14:38.866
He truly wants to be with you.

14:39.947 --> 14:40.906
He told me that

14:41.546 --> 14:43.187
even if you started wrong,

14:43.587 --> 14:44.587
he still hopes

14:45.260 --> 14:46.600
to have the right ending with you.

14:55.525 --> 14:57.146
He still owes me an answer.

15:00.546 --> 15:02.506
That's enough.
Stop meddling in my affairs.

15:02.587 --> 15:03.866
Just take care of your own first.

15:03.985 --> 15:04.587
Mujing.

15:05.427 --> 15:05.987
Fei Ni.

15:07.866 --> 15:08.546
Fei Ni?

15:08.546 --> 15:09.386
Fang Muyang.

15:09.546 --> 15:10.546
Why are you here?

15:10.746 --> 15:12.067
I finally found you.

15:12.067 --> 15:12.987
Why didn't you tell me

15:12.987 --> 15:14.347
you were visiting your sister?

15:14.650 --> 15:16.187
I wanted you to sleep a little longer.

15:16.746 --> 15:18.107
Besides, you had work.

15:18.110 --> 15:18.987
I'm on the afternoon shift.

15:18.987 --> 15:20.040
It wouldn't have affected me.

15:20.146 --> 15:20.866
Mujing,

15:21.107 --> 15:23.947
everything was rushed
when you came to the wedding.

15:23.947 --> 15:25.187
I didn't thank you properly.

15:25.386 --> 15:26.786
So I made you a gift.

15:29.427 --> 15:30.187
Gloves.

15:31.506 --> 15:32.307
Thank you.

15:32.310 --> 15:34.347
Anyway, the weather will turn cold
sooner or later.

15:34.347 --> 15:35.506
You'll definitely need them.

15:35.786 --> 15:36.746
They're beautiful.

15:41.060 --> 15:42.427
(Math Department Office)

15:42.427 --> 15:44.107
So this is the Math Department?

15:45.187 --> 15:45.866
Yes.

15:48.187 --> 15:48.707
Fei Ni,

15:49.146 --> 15:50.906
didn't you always want
to attend university?

15:50.987 --> 15:52.546
I'll take you around the campus.

15:53.546 --> 15:54.187
Sure.

16:13.227 --> 16:13.746
Zhao,

16:14.707 --> 16:15.427
what do you want?

16:15.746 --> 16:17.467
I'm going to get last month's
work summary.

16:17.987 --> 16:18.587
Let me.

16:22.546 --> 16:22.947
Here.

16:23.386 --> 16:24.546
Alright. Thank you, Mr. Fei.

16:24.746 --> 16:25.467
Let me help.

16:26.200 --> 16:26.746
Give it to me.

16:27.906 --> 16:28.987
Thank you, Mr. Fei.

16:29.987 --> 16:30.546
Chief Wang,

16:31.026 --> 16:31.746
let me.

16:40.107 --> 16:40.906
Thank you.

16:41.985 --> 16:44.285
(Guardhouse)

16:44.347 --> 16:45.107
Mr. Qiu,

16:45.587 --> 16:46.307
here's your water.

16:48.307 --> 16:49.347
- Thank you.
- Hold it carefully.

16:49.347 --> 16:49.987
Be careful.

16:50.740 --> 16:51.467
Hold it carefully.

16:51.467 --> 16:52.026
Alright.

16:53.546 --> 16:55.307
Mr. Li, let me help.

16:56.987 --> 16:58.546
Why are you buying vegetables alone?

16:59.307 --> 17:00.866
(Li Xuebing)
Someone in the canteen took leave today.

17:00.866 --> 17:02.026
We're short-handed.

17:02.146 --> 17:02.666
Wait for me.

17:02.740 --> 17:04.586
I'll put the thermos back
and come help you.

17:05.387 --> 17:06.026
Wait for me.

17:06.746 --> 17:07.867
Wait for me, Mr. Li.

17:08.746 --> 17:10.506
Mr. Fei really has energy.

17:11.740 --> 17:12.667
It's good to be young.

17:17.147 --> 17:17.947
You're back, Mr. Li.

17:17.947 --> 17:18.387
Alright.

17:18.786 --> 17:20.187
Hurry up. Unload the vegetables.

17:20.187 --> 17:20.627
Okay.

17:20.907 --> 17:21.746
Thank you, Mr. Fei.

17:22.120 --> 17:22.707
It's nothing.

17:29.480 --> 17:31.227
You're not even halfway done
with the prep?

17:31.586 --> 17:33.026
Will lunch be ready in time?

17:33.106 --> 17:34.867
Hurry up.

17:34.867 --> 17:36.627
Mr. Li, don't get worked up.

17:37.947 --> 17:38.546
How about this?

17:38.947 --> 17:40.066
I'll give you a hand.

17:40.346 --> 17:41.387
Won't hold you up?

17:41.746 --> 17:42.306
Not at all.

17:42.960 --> 17:44.250
Nothing much is going on anyway.

17:45.785 --> 17:47.072
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

18:27.026 --> 18:28.980
Looks like this floor
hasn't been swept in ages.

18:31.106 --> 18:32.786
This small room's pretty clean.

18:37.026 --> 18:37.987
Don't put it there.

18:39.306 --> 18:39.947
Dear,

18:41.546 --> 18:43.387
it's not even cold yet.

18:44.227 --> 18:46.147
Why did you bring a thick quilt?

18:46.306 --> 18:47.187
What do you mean?

18:47.187 --> 18:48.627
The young couple is working all day.

18:48.627 --> 18:50.066
How would they think of this?

18:50.346 --> 18:51.467
By the time they remember,

18:51.586 --> 18:52.947
they'll already have caught a cold.

18:53.746 --> 18:54.266
Here.

18:56.987 --> 19:00.546
Oh, the loving heart of a mother.

19:05.947 --> 19:06.707
Look at this.

19:07.346 --> 19:08.306
What's this?

19:12.310 --> 19:14.703
(Marriage Agreement. The two parties are husband
and wife in name only and shall not)

19:14.704 --> 19:16.035
(enjoy or fulfill any of the rights
and obligations of an actual married couple.)

19:16.185 --> 19:18.611
(After marriage, Fei Ni may attend college,
Fang Muyang shall not interfere for any reason)

19:18.612 --> 19:19.785
(Signed by Fang Muyang, Fei Ni,
July 1, 1975)

19:30.106 --> 19:31.106
What's written on it?

19:31.867 --> 19:33.707
It says here

19:34.427 --> 19:36.106
Ni and Fang got married

19:36.506 --> 19:39.147
to get housing.

19:39.560 --> 19:40.467
I'm going to see them.

19:41.147 --> 19:42.066
What are you doing?

19:42.066 --> 19:43.560
Shouldn't we at least ask them first?

19:43.907 --> 19:45.306
Lower your voice.

19:45.306 --> 19:46.867
Don't get so worked up.

19:46.987 --> 19:48.627
If you storm into the factory now

19:49.506 --> 19:50.546
and make a scene,

19:50.546 --> 19:51.867
everyone will find out

19:51.867 --> 19:54.467
they got married for housing.

19:54.987 --> 19:56.580
What are they supposed to do after this?

19:57.467 --> 19:59.506
Will Ni be able to keep her job?

20:07.947 --> 20:10.066
Fei Mingde, this is all your fault.

20:10.066 --> 20:11.147
I told you

20:11.147 --> 20:12.187
Fang wasn't suitable.

20:12.187 --> 20:13.546
You kept persuading me.

20:13.746 --> 20:15.387
He bought you over with a chessboard.

20:15.387 --> 20:15.907
No, I...

20:15.907 --> 20:16.667
Look at this now.

20:16.786 --> 20:18.227
Ni's whole future

20:18.227 --> 20:19.707
is at stake.

20:20.266 --> 20:21.467
What do we do?

20:21.667 --> 20:22.786
Calm down.

20:23.147 --> 20:24.546
It's my fault.

20:25.147 --> 20:25.826
Don't get angry.

20:26.066 --> 20:28.826
Maybe they were just fooling around.

20:30.586 --> 20:32.546
It's written in black and white.

20:32.546 --> 20:34.387
They both signed it.

20:34.387 --> 20:36.387
Who jokes about something like this?

20:39.467 --> 20:40.546
Don't get upset.

20:40.786 --> 20:42.147
This is what we'll do.

20:42.306 --> 20:43.506
We call them home,

20:43.546 --> 20:45.387
and we ask them properly.

20:45.947 --> 20:46.707
Okay?

20:56.935 --> 21:01.972
(Marriage Agreement, Signed by
Fang Muyang, Fei Ni, July 1, 1975)

21:03.306 --> 21:04.987
I really didn't expect you
to come today.

21:05.987 --> 21:07.467
We're married now.

21:07.467 --> 21:09.930
You went to visit your sister,
wouldn't it look odd if I weren't there?

21:09.947 --> 21:10.467
Why?

21:10.746 --> 21:11.987
Are you unhappy I came?

21:12.387 --> 21:13.467
Of course not.

21:14.187 --> 21:15.306
I'll be frank with you.

21:15.786 --> 21:18.786
Sometimes, I'm actually scared
to be alone with my sister.

21:19.346 --> 21:21.266
There's someone you're afraid of?

21:21.387 --> 21:23.840
Then I'll have to ask your sister

21:23.850 --> 21:24.907
how she keeps you in line.

21:24.907 --> 21:26.306
No need.

21:26.380 --> 21:28.306
You've already kept me
completely under control.

21:30.266 --> 21:32.586
You're really happy
after seeing your sister.

21:32.586 --> 21:34.147
Listen to that sweet talk.

21:34.346 --> 21:35.907
It's not because of her.

21:36.826 --> 21:38.066
I'm happy because

21:39.387 --> 21:42.066
we're starting to feel
more and more like a married couple.

21:47.786 --> 21:50.546
Let's go! I'm sending my wife to work!

22:07.710 --> 22:10.266
Dad, Mom, what's the occasion?

22:10.707 --> 22:11.826
Why call us back for lunch?

22:11.830 --> 22:12.950
I bought you some good food.

22:13.667 --> 22:14.066
Ni,

22:14.826 --> 22:15.586
close the door.

22:30.110 --> 22:30.907
What has happened?

22:33.506 --> 22:33.987
Ting,

22:34.227 --> 22:35.546
what did you do?

22:35.546 --> 22:36.786
Why is everyone so upset?

22:38.987 --> 22:39.786
Tell us.

22:40.667 --> 22:41.826
(Marriage Agreement)
Is this real or fake?

22:41.826 --> 22:44.122
(Marriage Agreement)

22:50.546 --> 22:51.346
- Fake.
- Real.

22:53.586 --> 22:54.306
- Fake.
- Real.

22:54.707 --> 22:56.187
So which is it?

23:01.467 --> 23:02.387
Speak!

23:03.506 --> 23:04.026
I...

23:04.707 --> 23:06.546
The marriage certificate is real.

23:08.907 --> 23:10.627
The marriage is fake.

23:14.066 --> 23:17.546
Oh my goodness.

23:17.867 --> 23:18.987
Don't get worked up, Mom.

23:20.707 --> 23:22.066
You're driving me crazy.

23:24.346 --> 23:25.506
Fang,

23:25.786 --> 23:28.266
you're a fine young man.

23:29.187 --> 23:31.306
How could you do something like this?

23:31.506 --> 23:32.746
Dad, please hear me out.

23:33.306 --> 23:34.227
Ridiculous!

23:34.907 --> 23:35.707
Listen up.

23:35.987 --> 23:37.346
Don't call me Dad anymore.

23:37.786 --> 23:39.707
I've treated you sincerely,

23:39.707 --> 23:41.987
and you repay me with betrayal.

23:42.187 --> 23:43.147
Fei Ni,

23:43.867 --> 23:45.947
how did I raise a daughter like you?

23:46.427 --> 23:48.187
How could you be so brazen?

23:48.546 --> 23:50.786
Dad, Mom, please don't be angry.

23:51.387 --> 23:52.387
It's on me.

23:52.387 --> 23:53.387
Fei Ni did it for me.

23:53.387 --> 23:54.467
If she hadn't married me,

23:54.467 --> 23:55.740
I wouldn't have gotten the room.

23:55.987 --> 23:57.786
It's all on me.

23:58.266 --> 23:59.786
Please don't blame Fei Ni.

23:59.786 --> 24:00.786
I knew it.

24:01.187 --> 24:03.227
You must've tricked my sister.

24:03.467 --> 24:05.387
I never should've let you
register the marriage with her.

24:05.387 --> 24:06.147
Ting,

24:06.786 --> 24:08.586
it has nothing to do with Fang Muyang.

24:08.760 --> 24:10.066
I was the one who suggested marriage.

24:10.066 --> 24:11.586
Stop defending him.

24:11.947 --> 24:13.387
Think about it.

24:13.387 --> 24:14.387
There's no way

24:15.066 --> 24:16.546
he could fool me.

24:17.106 --> 24:19.147
I was the one who wanted his room.

24:19.586 --> 24:20.746
If anyone lost out,

24:21.627 --> 24:23.147
it was him.

24:23.187 --> 24:24.387
Him?

24:24.387 --> 24:25.667
No, I didn't lose out.

24:26.266 --> 24:27.066
No.

24:27.266 --> 24:27.987
Fei Ni,

24:28.546 --> 24:29.947
I know you rushed into marriage

24:29.947 --> 24:31.987
to free up space for Fei Ting and me.

24:31.987 --> 24:34.187
If I'd known you were
sacrificing yourself for me,

24:34.387 --> 24:35.187
how could we have...

24:35.187 --> 24:35.987
Lin Mei.

24:36.147 --> 24:37.907
No, it's not like that.

24:38.147 --> 24:39.667
This was my own decision.

24:39.667 --> 24:41.227
It has nothing to do with you.

24:41.227 --> 24:41.786
Enough.

24:42.746 --> 24:43.746
Enough said.

24:44.346 --> 24:45.826
Go file for divorce tomorrow.

24:45.826 --> 24:46.746
Fei Ni, move back home.

24:47.746 --> 24:48.987
Are you crazy?

24:48.987 --> 24:49.947
Lower your voice.

24:49.947 --> 24:51.266
What nonsense are you saying?

24:51.266 --> 24:52.266
Divorce?

24:52.387 --> 24:53.187
Absolutely not.

24:53.387 --> 24:54.266
Your mom's right.

24:54.467 --> 24:55.746
If Ni divorces now,

24:55.867 --> 24:56.987
she'll be a divorcee.

24:56.987 --> 24:58.506
How will she explain that to people?

24:58.506 --> 24:59.387
What do we do?

24:59.387 --> 25:00.346
We can't let her

25:00.506 --> 25:02.346
stay with her like this.

25:02.346 --> 25:04.546
Even if they divorce, it can't be now.

25:04.546 --> 25:06.266
They just got married.

25:06.522 --> 25:08.987
If word gets out,

25:08.987 --> 25:10.147
it'll be big trouble.

25:10.147 --> 25:10.546
No way.

25:10.546 --> 25:13.667
What matters most now is
that he took advantage of my sister.

25:13.667 --> 25:14.786
Keep it down.

25:14.786 --> 25:16.160
No one should find out about this.

25:16.746 --> 25:18.227
Will you all stop?

25:21.667 --> 25:23.147
I married him

25:23.907 --> 25:25.467
for the house.

25:25.546 --> 25:26.506
But now

25:26.947 --> 25:27.387
I...

25:33.707 --> 25:35.546
I really do like him.

25:38.387 --> 25:39.306
Besides,

25:41.147 --> 25:42.546
we get along well.

25:43.066 --> 25:44.546
We're not a fake couple,

25:44.546 --> 25:45.746
and we're not divorcing.

25:48.987 --> 25:51.147
At a time like this,

25:51.546 --> 25:54.467
you're still lying to us?

25:55.586 --> 25:57.387
For crying out loud!

25:57.387 --> 25:57.987
Mom.

26:00.130 --> 26:00.947
Mom, don't get upset.

26:00.947 --> 26:02.387
I'm furious.

26:02.786 --> 26:03.786
I'm telling you,

26:04.786 --> 26:06.147
you're moving back tonight.

26:22.707 --> 26:23.546
Don't see me off.

26:24.560 --> 26:25.867
Your brother might come chasing.

26:28.066 --> 26:28.950
This is all my fault.

26:29.586 --> 26:31.987
I should've hidden
that agreement better.

26:32.147 --> 26:33.106
Don't be upset.

26:33.867 --> 26:36.066
Your family is just worried about you.

26:36.667 --> 26:38.667
I just don't want them to worry.

26:38.960 --> 26:40.746
I don't want them
to feel like they owe me.

26:42.147 --> 26:43.427
So what you said earlier

26:44.346 --> 26:45.387
was meant to comfort them?

26:49.786 --> 26:50.546
Just now, I...

26:50.907 --> 26:51.987
Not entirely.

26:53.387 --> 26:54.627
I really do feel

26:54.627 --> 26:56.147
our life together gets better.

26:56.707 --> 26:58.786
I'm not as wronged as they think.

27:00.707 --> 27:02.506
You said you liked me.

27:04.147 --> 27:04.987
Was that fake too?

27:09.586 --> 27:10.546
Fang Muyang.

27:12.467 --> 27:12.907
You...

27:13.546 --> 27:15.066
Think of something.

27:15.066 --> 27:16.346
Stop joking.

27:17.106 --> 27:18.066
There's a way.

27:18.170 --> 27:19.960
But it's up to you
if you're willing to cooperate.

27:19.987 --> 27:20.786
I am.

27:20.786 --> 27:22.187
Of course I am.

27:28.546 --> 27:29.346
Fang,

27:30.627 --> 27:31.826
about you and Fei Ni,

27:32.667 --> 27:35.026
we have discussed this over and over.

27:35.546 --> 27:37.147
Divorce isn't appropriate right now.

27:37.260 --> 27:39.306
But in the long run,
we're afraid Ni will suffer.

27:40.227 --> 27:41.266
How about this?

27:41.867 --> 27:42.667
One year.

27:43.070 --> 27:44.306
You get a divorce after one year.

27:44.306 --> 27:45.826
I will not divorce Fei Ni.

27:48.066 --> 27:48.867
You two...

27:51.427 --> 27:52.266
Fang,

27:52.867 --> 27:56.586
I'd love to have you be my son-in-law.

27:57.147 --> 27:58.506
However,

27:58.786 --> 28:00.746
love can't be forced.

28:01.227 --> 28:02.667
You don't need to comfort us.

28:05.147 --> 28:06.427
I mean every word.

28:09.066 --> 28:10.387
Let me show you something.

28:12.872 --> 28:14.947
(Sketchbook)

28:15.147 --> 28:16.786
I drew these when I was in the hospital.

28:24.786 --> 28:26.026
When I first woke up,

28:26.147 --> 28:27.627
I couldn't remember anything

28:28.867 --> 28:30.147
or anyone.

28:30.987 --> 28:32.467
Fei Ni asked me to draw.

28:33.546 --> 28:35.467
But there was only one shadow
in my mind.

28:36.947 --> 28:38.106
So I drew her

28:38.106 --> 28:39.026
again and again.

28:39.467 --> 28:41.786
Until the day Fei Ni
almost gave up on me.

28:42.066 --> 28:43.467
That shadow suddenly turned around.

28:44.546 --> 28:45.786
That's when I knew who she was.

28:46.460 --> 28:48.586
The person who had been living
in my head all along

28:51.746 --> 28:53.346
was Fei Ni.

28:55.770 --> 28:57.187
I want to see her every single day.

28:57.826 --> 28:58.987
If I don't see her,

28:59.786 --> 29:01.867
it feels like something's wrong.

29:04.826 --> 29:06.106
So I kept drawing

29:06.786 --> 29:07.586
and drawing.

29:08.066 --> 29:10.266
Because I wanted to
keep the image of her

29:13.187 --> 29:13.987
in my mind.

29:16.026 --> 29:17.786
Everyone says my brain was damaged,

29:18.867 --> 29:20.340
and since she was the only one around,

29:20.987 --> 29:22.227
I grew dependent on her.

29:23.746 --> 29:25.266
But only I know

29:27.066 --> 29:28.147
that what I feel for her

29:31.667 --> 29:33.026
was never just dependence.

29:44.346 --> 29:45.187
It's love.

29:55.667 --> 29:56.467
Fang,

29:57.467 --> 29:59.187
I'm confused.

30:01.586 --> 30:02.427
If that's the case,

30:02.786 --> 30:04.907
you liked Ni long ago.

30:05.586 --> 30:06.987
Then why

30:07.707 --> 30:08.947
lie to us?

30:09.987 --> 30:12.066
Dad, I liked Fei Ni before,

30:12.867 --> 30:14.066
but she didn't like me.

30:14.227 --> 30:16.867
I thought once the factory assigned
the house for me,

30:17.227 --> 30:18.627
I could lend it to her.

30:19.266 --> 30:20.586
But something went wrong.

30:21.427 --> 30:22.506
I never imagined

30:23.306 --> 30:25.427
she'd marry me

30:26.427 --> 30:27.667
to help me get it back.

30:28.427 --> 30:30.026
Maybe I did take advantage.

30:30.586 --> 30:31.667
Even if it started fake,

30:32.667 --> 30:34.266
being able to live with her

30:36.346 --> 30:37.826
was the happiest thing for me.

30:39.066 --> 30:40.427
What surprised me most

30:40.980 --> 30:42.620
was that in the time we spent together,

30:43.467 --> 30:45.026
you actually fell in love with me.

30:46.786 --> 30:48.227
To be honest,

30:51.867 --> 30:53.427
I never thought

30:54.227 --> 30:55.467
I'd fall for you.

30:56.187 --> 30:57.667
It's not that you're bad.

30:58.427 --> 31:00.667
I've known you since Grade 3.

31:01.546 --> 31:02.947
Back then, I knew

31:04.467 --> 31:06.026
we weren't the same kind of people.

31:06.266 --> 31:07.667
You splurged a lot.

31:08.586 --> 31:09.707
To put it nicely,

31:09.987 --> 31:11.427
you were carefree and optimistic.

31:12.346 --> 31:13.467
But frankly,

31:14.147 --> 31:15.427
you were reckless.

31:16.867 --> 31:17.667
That being said,

31:18.707 --> 31:19.627
it was you

31:21.066 --> 31:22.066
who made me understand

31:23.786 --> 31:25.786
that no matter how hard life is,

31:27.066 --> 31:29.266
when two people share it,

31:31.187 --> 31:32.187
it becomes lighter.

31:33.826 --> 31:35.266
And you taught me

31:36.467 --> 31:37.546
life

31:38.306 --> 31:40.066
isn't only about distant goals.

31:42.040 --> 31:43.710
It's also about the scenery
right in front of you.

31:43.722 --> 31:46.872
♪How I wish I could
be a firefly for you in the night♪

31:47.060 --> 31:48.647
♪Guiding you toward the horizon♪

31:49.147 --> 31:51.826
I used to think I was unlucky,

31:53.746 --> 31:56.586
that luck was never on my side.

31:59.667 --> 32:01.667
But only now do I realize

32:03.387 --> 32:05.467
that all that good fortune

32:06.786 --> 32:08.227
had been saved up

32:10.346 --> 32:11.147
so I could meet you.

32:11.147 --> 32:16.172
♪For the rest of our lives,
let's not count the years♪

32:16.422 --> 32:21.410
♪How I wish I could
be a firefly for you in the night♪

32:21.547 --> 32:25.360
♪Guiding you toward the horizon
as you go to see a wider world♪

32:25.660 --> 32:28.860
♪How lucky we are
to have chosen each other♪

32:28.860 --> 32:32.797
♪Our hearts shine for each other♪

32:32.872 --> 32:34.710
♪Let me become♪

32:34.746 --> 32:35.826
It looks just like her.

32:36.826 --> 32:38.227
That's my daughter.

32:38.227 --> 32:41.735
♪Burning with endless light,
I'll tell our story with my life♪

32:41.822 --> 32:45.222
♪Stars lean into the twilight,
you lean on me♪

32:45.347 --> 32:51.060
♪For the rest of our lives,
let's not count the years♪

32:51.347 --> 32:55.360
♪I'll walk beside you♪

33:03.826 --> 33:05.947
Did you rehearse many times

33:06.627 --> 33:08.947
what you said earlier?

33:11.826 --> 33:13.227
Every word I said

33:13.907 --> 33:14.947
came from the heart.

33:18.066 --> 33:19.546
You were pretty sincere.

33:28.026 --> 33:29.227
You also drew

33:30.040 --> 33:31.786
Nurse Zhou in the sketchbook,
didn't you?

33:32.266 --> 33:32.786
No.

33:33.546 --> 33:34.266
Only you.

33:36.387 --> 33:38.306
I saw it when I went to the hospital.

33:38.306 --> 33:39.987
You drew her.

33:54.667 --> 33:55.786
I like you.

34:06.147 --> 34:07.467
The moment I first saw you,

34:09.747 --> 34:10.827
I liked you.

34:12.747 --> 34:14.066
I carry this feeling

34:15.226 --> 34:16.626
across half of China.

34:17.226 --> 34:18.550
From Jiangcheng No. 2 High School,

34:18.827 --> 34:19.666
to Beidahuang,

34:20.987 --> 34:21.987
and back to Jiangcheng.

34:23.827 --> 34:25.467
If you call it a rehearsal,

34:26.427 --> 34:27.347
then I've rehearsed it

34:30.467 --> 34:32.267
in my heart countless times.

34:40.427 --> 34:41.267
Just now...

34:45.546 --> 34:47.427
Everything I said earlier today

34:50.186 --> 34:51.706
was sincere too.

34:54.907 --> 34:55.787
Fang Muyang,

35:00.747 --> 35:02.026
I like you.

36:15.467 --> 36:17.186
Artists really are different.

36:17.867 --> 36:19.747
What Fang Muyang said

36:20.020 --> 36:21.506
sounded like something out of a movie.

36:22.387 --> 36:24.307
What's the use of sweet talk?

36:24.650 --> 36:26.307
Do you know what matters most in a man?

36:26.666 --> 36:27.347
Grounded.

36:27.580 --> 36:28.666
Responsible for the family.

36:28.787 --> 36:29.907
Able to shoulder things.

36:30.666 --> 36:31.506
I'm telling you,

36:31.586 --> 36:32.907
if he ever treats Ni badly,

36:32.987 --> 36:33.907
I'll beat him up.

36:35.307 --> 36:36.506
Don't be ridiculous.

36:37.026 --> 36:38.586
If you really beat him up,

36:38.586 --> 36:41.060
you'll just put Fei Ni
in an awkward position between you two.

36:42.307 --> 36:44.706
I think this brother-in-law's
pretty decent.

36:44.706 --> 36:45.226
Hold it.

36:45.827 --> 36:48.106
Whether he's my brother-in-law
is still up in the air.

36:48.666 --> 36:51.066
Mom and Dad said,
since they deceived us,

36:51.387 --> 36:52.867
no matter how they try to explain it,

36:53.066 --> 36:54.666
we can't let it slide.

36:54.987 --> 36:56.267
We have to look into it properly.

36:56.706 --> 36:58.787
Only then can we put
this matter to rest.

36:59.666 --> 37:00.867
I say that's unnecessary.

37:01.026 --> 37:02.226
They're clearly doing great.

37:04.666 --> 37:05.947
I used to think

37:06.347 --> 37:08.907
it was a pity
Fei Ni didn't marry Ye Feng.

37:09.267 --> 37:11.226
Now I see it was fate.

37:12.267 --> 37:13.387
The more I look at them,

37:13.787 --> 37:15.066
the better they suit each other.

37:20.427 --> 37:21.066
Fei Ting,

37:21.706 --> 37:23.307
let's go see a movie this weekend.

37:25.787 --> 37:26.186
No.

37:26.626 --> 37:27.787
What's the point?

37:27.907 --> 37:28.987
Waste of money and time.

37:30.666 --> 37:32.427
Can't you learn something
from Fang Muyang?

37:32.626 --> 37:33.226
You!

37:34.427 --> 37:34.907
What?

37:35.427 --> 37:36.427
Add some hot water.

37:40.307 --> 37:41.427
Learn from him?

37:42.427 --> 37:43.307
Learn what?

37:44.186 --> 37:45.787
His sweet talk?

37:45.907 --> 37:46.867
His lies?

37:46.867 --> 37:47.666
Stop mumbling.

37:49.506 --> 37:50.307
Move your feet.

37:53.546 --> 37:54.626
That's enough.

37:56.546 --> 37:57.026
Alright.

38:18.622 --> 38:22.085
(Union Committee)

38:22.106 --> 38:22.706
Fang Muyang.

38:24.506 --> 38:25.586
Why are you running?

38:25.586 --> 38:26.987
I don't you want to wait too long.

38:27.506 --> 38:28.506
You're sweating all over.

38:28.827 --> 38:29.626
Let me wipe it off.

38:32.226 --> 38:33.747
Your button is undone again.

38:34.827 --> 38:35.706
Let me wipe it.

38:35.706 --> 38:36.040
Alright.

38:36.307 --> 38:37.586
Ye Feng, you're here.

38:50.226 --> 38:52.427
Ye Feng, didn't you see me just now?

38:52.747 --> 38:53.907
Let me introduce you.

38:54.387 --> 38:55.907
This is my girlfriend, Ling Yi.

38:56.427 --> 38:57.626
You all know her, don't you?

38:58.026 --> 38:59.987
She's a student
at Jiangcheng University.

39:02.186 --> 39:02.827
Fei Ni,

39:03.626 --> 39:05.666
didn't you always want
to go to college?

39:05.907 --> 39:07.387
Why not ask Ling Yi for some advice?

39:12.307 --> 39:14.106
Ye Feng, the movie's about to start.

39:14.106 --> 39:14.907
Let's go.

39:15.427 --> 39:16.520
If we can't watch it today,

39:16.706 --> 39:17.747
we'll watch it tomorrow.

39:17.947 --> 39:18.747
No rush.

39:19.226 --> 39:20.626
As long as you want to see one,

39:21.307 --> 39:22.987
we can go to the cinema every day.

39:28.580 --> 39:30.740
I don't ever want to watch
another movie in my life.

39:31.146 --> 39:33.546
That won't do. You have to go with me.

39:34.586 --> 39:35.427
Sure.

39:35.546 --> 39:37.947
If Fei Ni wants,
Fang Muyang has to go with her.

39:38.146 --> 39:39.267
Fei Ni wants to watch it.

39:40.427 --> 39:42.666
By the way, we have plans later.
We'll get going.

39:42.827 --> 39:43.226
Let's go.

39:43.226 --> 39:43.907
Right.

39:43.907 --> 39:45.260
We've got something important.

39:48.146 --> 39:49.427
Enjoy the movie.

39:49.427 --> 39:50.186
Bye.

39:54.427 --> 39:55.226
Wait.

39:56.146 --> 39:57.186
Why did they

39:57.186 --> 39:59.347
state their names just now?

40:02.427 --> 40:03.347
Where are you going?

40:04.106 --> 40:04.947
Back to campus.

40:05.186 --> 40:06.307
Not watching the movie?

40:06.347 --> 40:07.146
No.

40:14.546 --> 40:16.026
Fine, don't.

40:16.026 --> 40:17.026
Why are you mad?

40:26.146 --> 40:26.987
Excuse me, sir.

40:26.987 --> 40:27.427
Excuse me.

40:27.427 --> 40:29.146
Which way is the Publicity Department?

40:29.146 --> 40:30.307
Through here.

40:30.626 --> 40:31.186
Thank you.

40:31.186 --> 40:31.987
You're welcome.

40:38.860 --> 40:40.827
(Actively Carry Out
the Patriotic Healthy Campaign)

40:40.827 --> 40:41.787
Excuse me.

40:41.787 --> 40:43.026
Hello, who are you looking for?

40:43.026 --> 40:44.026
I'm looking for Fei Ting.

40:44.947 --> 40:46.026
I'm his wife.

40:46.267 --> 40:47.226
Fei Ting?

40:47.787 --> 40:48.787
I haven't seen him.

40:49.546 --> 40:51.626
He went to lunch and hasn't come back.

40:54.307 --> 40:55.066
Thank you.

41:00.210 --> 41:02.385
(Staff Canteen)

41:02.427 --> 41:06.146
♪Bathed in sunshine♪

41:06.867 --> 41:10.626
♪With lofty ideals in our hearts♪

41:11.146 --> 41:16.026
♪We educated youths go up the mountains
and down to the countryside♪

41:16.026 --> 41:19.546
♪Vowing to unite
with the workers and peasants♪

41:20.026 --> 41:23.066
♪Let our youthful brilliance shine♪

41:23.066 --> 41:23.867
Fei Ting.

41:25.186 --> 41:25.666
Lin Mei,

41:26.226 --> 41:27.307
why are you here?

41:27.706 --> 41:28.787
What are you doing here?

41:29.666 --> 41:31.307
You're an officer in Publicity.

41:31.506 --> 41:33.387
Why are you here picking vegetables?

41:33.706 --> 41:34.666
Who told you to do this?

41:34.960 --> 41:35.787
This is outrageous.

41:35.787 --> 41:36.586
I'm going to find your supervisor.

41:36.586 --> 41:37.267
Come back.

41:38.066 --> 41:38.987
No one told me.

41:39.106 --> 41:40.747
I volunteered.

41:43.666 --> 41:44.747
What for?

41:44.987 --> 41:47.186
The Publicity Department is too idle.

41:47.347 --> 41:49.307
All we do is drink tea and chat.

41:49.546 --> 41:51.106
I'm bored out of my mind.

41:51.706 --> 41:52.787
Fei Ting,

41:53.307 --> 41:54.987
what's there to be bored about?

41:55.467 --> 41:58.146
Even if you drink and chat, that's fine.

41:58.146 --> 41:59.787
You're still getting paid every cent.

42:00.987 --> 42:01.987
Besides,

42:02.347 --> 42:03.546
tea and chatting

42:03.546 --> 42:05.787
help you build connections
with leadership.

42:07.106 --> 42:08.666
What's the point of picking vegetables?

42:09.760 --> 42:11.026
Who says I only pick vegetables?

42:11.307 --> 42:13.106
I just helped the head chef cook.

42:13.546 --> 42:14.226
Did you forget?

42:14.230 --> 42:15.307
Back in the production brigade,

42:15.307 --> 42:16.506
I loved cooking
for the big communal meals.

42:16.506 --> 42:17.987
You all said my cooking was delicious.

42:17.987 --> 42:19.747
But this isn't Beidahuang anymore.

42:24.666 --> 42:26.706
Fei Ting, for crying out loud.

42:27.347 --> 42:28.467
You're driving me crazy.

42:28.467 --> 42:29.146
Wait.

42:29.747 --> 42:30.546
What's this?

42:31.387 --> 42:33.787
Lin Mei, what's wrong?

42:37.186 --> 42:38.267
Why are you mad?

42:39.387 --> 42:40.387
Look at you.

42:40.787 --> 42:42.546
Do you even look
like a Publicity officer?

42:45.506 --> 42:46.307
Lin Mei,

42:46.787 --> 42:48.146
Publicity is work.

42:48.146 --> 42:49.550
Working in the canteen is work too.

42:49.560 --> 42:50.880
Don't try to twist things around.

42:51.080 --> 42:53.066
Holding a pen
isn't the same as holding a ladle.

42:53.987 --> 42:54.907
And on top of that,

42:55.160 --> 42:57.907
you're taking the Publicity Department's
pay and doing canteen work.

42:58.747 --> 43:00.387
What would Chief Wang think?

43:03.467 --> 43:04.867
I didn't think about that.

43:05.747 --> 43:06.506
Exactly.

43:06.706 --> 43:08.506
You're simple-minded.

43:08.947 --> 43:09.706
Mm.

43:10.706 --> 43:12.907
I'll let Chief Wang know
before I come next time.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
